{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n現年64歲的歐瑞偉在TVB節目《愛．回家之三代同糖》中再次展示驚人體能，完全不像已屆花甲之年！在最新一集中，他上演一幕「英雄救美」，不但一腳破門氣勢十足，更輕鬆使出一記漂亮的「過肩摔」，將對手唐嘉麟（KT）應聲撻生魚，畫面極具震撼力，其身手連不少後生仔都自愧不如！\n</p>\n<h2>一腳破門英雄救美 歐瑞偉過肩摔盡顯真功夫</h2>\n<p>在劇情尾聲，歐瑞偉為救人而霸氣登場，他先是一腳踹開大門，盡顯功架。面對唐嘉麟飾演的惡人揮出重拳，他不但輕易擋下，更順勢一手揪起對方的褲頭，乾淨利落地施展一記「過肩摔」，將KT整個人撻在地上制服。整個動作行雲流水，勁爆體能令人咋舌。而幕後花絮片段則揭開了拍攝秘密，原來拍攝時唐嘉麟有站在一個木箱上，讓歐瑞偉能夠更輕易地完成這個高難度動作，但其功力依然毋庸置疑。</p>\n<h2>歐瑞偉親解動作場面 「最緊要用柔勁唔會受傷」</h2>\n<p>對於這場精彩的對打戲，歐瑞偉接受官方訪問時表現得相當輕鬆，他笑言：「其實呢啲動作對我嚟講唔係好難。」他解釋拍攝時最重要的是突顯角色的靈敏度，而非單純使用蠻力。為了保護對手演員，他更強調了技巧的重要性：「同埋要用柔勁，對方先唔會受傷。」一言一語盡顯其數十年的動作戲功底與專業精神，確保了拍攝既有視覺衝擊力，又安全順利。</p>\n<h2>對手唐嘉麟百分百信任 爆一Take過完成勁專業</h2>\n<p>作為被「撻」的一方，唐嘉麟（KT）在訪問中表示對歐瑞偉是百分百信任。他憶述當時歐瑞偉曾細心詢問他拍攝方式是否可行，KT當時毫不猶豫地笑著回應：「瑞偉哥問我咁拍得唔得？我話第二個就唔得，你就一定得。」這份信任源於歐瑞偉的豐富經驗。KT更透露，這場高難度的過肩摔場面，雙方僅僅綵排了一次，正式拍攝時更是一Take過完成，他大讚歐瑞偉拍攝動作戲的能力非常強，令人佩服。</p>\n<h2>網民驚嘆體能勁過後生仔 「完全唔似64歲！」</h2>\n<p>歐瑞偉的驚人身手引來網民熱烈討論，紛紛表示難以置信。有網民留言大讚：「嘩！瑞偉哥真係寶刀未老！」不少人對過肩摔一幕印象深刻：「呢個過肩摔勁到！完全唔似64歲！」更有觀眾感嘆他的體能遠超年輕人：「後生仔都未必做到，太屈機！」、「真功夫！睇到好緊張！」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_19083604296ae2dba84599f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_19083604296ae2dba84599f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/19_11466646746ae2dbaba3c29.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/19_11466646746ae2dbaba3c29.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20_12016963896ae2dbaeaa9a7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20_12016963896ae2dbaeaa9a7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/21_9179223966ae2dbb22436e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/21_9179223966ae2dbb22436e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/22_21407828686ae2dbb4cd0b7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/22_21407828686ae2dbb4cd0b7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/23_18954288356ae2dbb8164bb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/23_18954288356ae2dbb8164bb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24_1190329286ae2dbbc4236e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24_1190329286ae2dbbc4236e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25_17250713906ae2dbbfa6e25.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25_17250713906ae2dbbfa6e25.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/28_10839226766ae2dbc4252ca.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/28_10839226766ae2dbc4252ca.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/29_4292230906ae2dbc62d202.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/29_4292230906ae2dbc62d202.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T12:01:37.944762+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1194,"images":10,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T11:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T12:38:40.366887+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T11:58:40.185607+00:00","content_hash":"57c53e5d0919c2e08b96633d8a040f86c3258d7be801c079412d610b1bd7b9a7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}